(a) the defendant did not have a safety committee, but that CSR Emoleum Road Services did have such a committee;
(b) the defendant did not have a safety policy to his knowledge, but that CSR Emoleum Road Services did have such a policy;
(c) the defendant did not monitor the effectiveness of the safety policy, but that CSR Emoleum Road Services did so;
